// Ultra-Defensive (10 Back) manager archetype — hand-authored, NOT LLM-baked.
//
// Extreme edge-case defensive tactician. Even deeper than park-the-bus
// (back-line at -44 vs -42); lone narrow striker as hopeful counter
// outlet. Catalog-min risk appetite (0.10) — protecting a slim lead is
// the only acceptable game state; conceding is the failure mode.
// Catalog-min possession preference (0.15) — possession is a hot potato
// that exposes us to turnovers; hoof + reset is the default.
//
// Q32 raw-bits computation (BAKE-TIME math; never in canonical paths):
//   risk_appetite:         0.10 × 2^32 = 429_496_729.6 → 429_496_730
//   possession_preference: 0.15 × 2^32 = 644_245_094.4 → 644_245_094
//
// Tactical archetype reference resolves to content/sources/archetypes/
//   ultra-defensive-10-back.ron  (validated at load time by ContentStore).
//
// Authored 2026-05-17 (T2-1c).

ManagerArchetype(
    schema_version: 1,
    id: "fwh.core:manager.ultra-defensive-10-back",
    display_name: "Ultra-Defensive (10 Back)",
    tactical_archetype_id: "fwh.core:archetype.ultra-defensive-10-back",
